"""Long-form article — Best Trailer Hitches for 2020–2025 Hyundai Palisade (1st gen, LX2).
Mirrors the approved pilot (ford_f150_2021_tonneau.py). No invented hands-on testing: Palisade towing equipment from
Hyundai's 2023 Palisade spec sheet; hitch ratings from CURT and Draw-Tite; hidden-hitch details from Stealth Hitches;
harness fitment from CURT (all in SOURCES, checked 2026-09-24). Amazon picks by listing title.
Angle (distinct from the Telluride page): Hyundai lists pre-wiring and a heavy-duty transmission cooler as standard, so
the hitch is the missing piece; the 2023 facelift splits wiring and hidden-hitch parts into 2020–2022 and 2023–2025;
and the 1,650 lb unbraked limit decides whether a small trailer needs brakes.
"""

